# Output contract: Implement iteration

## Required stdout signals (exactly one)

- `<promise>COMPLETE</promise>` — all ROADMAP tasks `passes: true` and verify green.
- `<promise>ITERATION_DONE</promise>` — this iteration finished; more tasks or fixes remain.

## Progress file line format

Append to `progress.txt`:

```text
YYYY/MM/DD HH:MM | implement | exit {{EXIT_CODE}} | {{ONE_LINE_SUMMARY}}
```

## Forbidden

- Claiming complete while verify failed
- Empty summary lines
